# https://transit.ac.uk/ontologies/gtfs#agency_email
<https://transit.ac.uk/ontologies/gtfs#agency_email> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://transit.ac.uk/ontologies/gtfs#agency_email> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://transit.ac.uk/ontologies/gtfs#Agency> .
<https://transit.ac.uk/ontologies/gtfs#agency_email> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://transit.ac.uk/ontologies/gtfs#email> .
<https://transit.ac.uk/ontologies/gtfs#agency_email> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Email address actively monitored by the agency’s customer service department. This email address should be a direct contact point where transit riders can reach a customer service representative at the agency."@en .
<https://transit.ac.uk/ontologies/gtfs#agency_email> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "agency email address"@en .
# 
# https://transit.ac.uk/ontologies/gtfs#agency_fare_url
<https://transit.ac.uk/ontologies/gtfs#agency_fare_url> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://transit.ac.uk/ontologies/gtfs#agency_fare_url> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://transit.ac.uk/ontologies/gtfs#Agency> .
<https://transit.ac.uk/ontologies/gtfs#agency_fare_url> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://transit.ac.uk/ontologies/gtfs#url> .
<https://transit.ac.uk/ontologies/gtfs#agency_fare_url> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "URL of a web page where a rider can purchase tickets or other fare instruments for that agency, or a web page containing information about that agency's fares."@en .
<https://transit.ac.uk/ontologies/gtfs#agency_fare_url> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "agency fare URL"@en .
# 
# https://transit.ac.uk/ontologies/gtfs#agency_id
<https://transit.ac.uk/ontologies/gtfs#agency_id> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://transit.ac.uk/ontologies/gtfs#agency_id> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
