<https://transit.ac.uk/ontologies/gtfs#agency_id> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://transit.ac.uk/ontologies/gtfs#id> .
<https://transit.ac.uk/ontologies/gtfs#agency_id> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Identifies a transit brand which is often synonymous with a transit agency. Note that in some cases, such as when a single agency operates multiple separate services, agencies and brands are distinct. This [ontology] uses the term \"agency\" in place of \"brand\". A dataset may contain data from multiple agencies."@en .
<https://transit.ac.uk/ontologies/gtfs#agency_id> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "agency ID"@en .
# 
