<https://transit.ac.uk/ontologies/gtfs#agency_timezone> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Timezone where the transit agency is located. If multiple agencies are specified in the dataset, each must have the same agency_timezone."@en .
<https://transit.ac.uk/ontologies/gtfs#agency_timezone> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "agency timezone"@en .
